{"id":"n23701-1-7","stage":4,"title":"건성 · 马虎","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23701-1-7-1","ko":"넌 하는 일마다 왜 그렇게 건성이니?","zh":"你做的每件事怎么总是这么马虎呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"일마다","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일마다","audio":"/audio/ca2cc563106acc97376a.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"건성이니?","meaning":"马虎，装样子","explanation":"건성：马虎，装样子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"건성","audio":"/audio/7ea4f78b1143d0ff3ef1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23701","senseId":"1","lemma":"건성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건성이니","audio":"/audio/2677f08cd66fd42b1168.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"7ea4f78b1143d0ff","term":"건성","zh":"马虎，装样子","audio":"/audio/7ea4f78b1143d0ff3ef1.mp3","entryId":"23701","definition":"不花心思、没有诚意地大概做一下。","pronunciation":["건성"]}],"audio":"/audio/742e348912dff0910ae1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23701-1-7-2","ko":"나름대로는 열심히 하고 있어요.","zh":"我其实已经很努力了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나름대로는","meaning":"各自具有的特殊的方式、性格或状态。","explanation":"나름：各自具有的特殊的方式、性格或状态；대로：表示“按照、就……而言、各自”；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나름","audio":"/audio/56701190dbce236daeea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38833","senseId":"2","lemma":"나름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나름대로는","audio":"/audio/ce8c3835389acf03448e.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地。","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meanin